###< symfony/framework-bundle ###

# Symfony has been observed auto-generating a real APP_SECRET into
# .env.<env> files (e.g. .env.dev) on first run, which the recipe above
# does NOT gitignore since .env.$APP_ENV is normally meant to hold committed
# non-secret defaults. Treat that as untrusted here and never commit it.
/.env.dev
/.env.prod
/.env.test

# Uploaded photo files (local Flysystem storage stand-in for DO Spaces -
# see ROADMAP.md Phase 2). User content, not source - never committed.
/public/media/
